## 2. Protein Feature (PF) Attribution

**PFES** is the sum of log odds ratios (OR) across protein features showing statistically significant enrichment in the **case (pathogenic) variants** versus the **control (benign and common population) variants**:
<p style="text-align:center; margin: 1em 0;">
  PFES = &sum;<sub><i>i</i> &isin; significant</sub> log(OR<sub><i>i</i></sub>)
</p>

